# Project conventions

- Four stages: Discover → Pipeline → Booking → Service. Stage transitions and tool allow-lists live in `src/agent/stages.ts`, not in the model prompt alone.
- LLM: Groq → OpenRouter (`:free` default) → Gemini; first keyed provider wins; others used on failover.
- CRM writes only through Zod-validated tool handlers. Never call Zoho from the prompt or client.
- `CRM_MODE=mock` must throw in production.
- Keep `docs/*.md` in sync when stage rules, request path, or Zoho env change.
- Secrets stay server-only. Never prefix LLM or Zoho keys with `NEXT_PUBLIC_`.
- Do not log phone, email, booking ids, or registration numbers.
